rence = \"TLC1215\", Pset_WindowCommon.ThermalTransmittance = 3.6886. Window 2 must be restored on the straight wall running south, 16758 mm long, 2409.2 mm high and 240 mm thick, storey elevation 0 mm, with an opening 2000 mm wide by 1800 mm high, sill 409.2 mm and centre offset 6715 mm from wall start; reuse the existing IfcWindowStyle with GlobalId 1PkWQ2IbXBH9Ib7U4dBYvz, including its mapped representation; do not generate a new Type. Give window 2 these exact occurrence properties: Pset_QuantityTakeOff.Reference = \"BY2018\", Pset_WindowCommon.IsExternal = true, Pset_WindowCommon.Reference = \"BY2018\", Pset_WindowCommon.ThermalTransmittance = 3.7021. Every structural axis is fully determined by its endpoints; do not substitute a scalar length. All listed operations are mandatory and atomic.",
